  "description": "Noelle Russell, Founder of the AI Leadership Institute, presents The Frontier Value Method: From Token Spend to Business Value at The AI House presented by KPMG during Microsoft Ignite 2026 in San Francisco, Wednesday November 18, 12:45PM Pacific, at KPMG Exchange, 175 4th St. Three steps: pick the right workflows, model the human-agent cost, underwrite outcomes, not tokens.",
