  "transcript": "[00:00] Everyone is spending on AI.\n[00:02] Who is measuring the value? (chart: AI spend rises, measured value stays flat: the gap)\n[00:04] Microsoft Ignite 2026. San Francisco. Nov 17–20. Moscone Center and online.\n[00:07] Presented by KPMG: The AI House. The room where enterprise AI gets done.\n[00:09] Noelle Russell, Founder, AI Leadership Institute. #1 Agentic AI Leader 2025. 5x Microsoft AI MVP. 3.4M+ learners. TEDx speaker. Best-selling author.\n[00:14] The session: The Frontier Value Method: From Token Spend to Business Value.\n[00:18] The Frontier Value Method: 1. Pick the right workflows. 2. Model the human-agent cost. 3. Underwrite outcomes, not tokens. With KPMG, GitHub and Credit Karma.\n[00:26] The AI House, presented by KPMG. Wed Nov 18, 12:45PM Pacific. KPMG Exchange, 175 4th St, San Francisco. Invitation only.\n[00:31] Noelle Russell. Responsible AI that scales. Founder, AI Leadership Institute.",
